i>\n<li>Community support</li>\n<li class=\"off\">Custom domains</li>\n<li class=\"off\">Shared workspaces</li>\n<li class=\"off\">Audit log &amp; SSO</li>\n</ul>\n<button class=\"btn btn-outline btn-block\">Get started free</button>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"card plan featured\">\n<div class=\"row between\"><h3>Pro</h3><span class=\"badge\">Most popular</span></div>\n<p class=\"muted small\">For professionals who need more power and polish.</p>\n<div><span class=\"price\" data-m=\"12\" data-y=\"9\">$12</span> <span class=\"muted\">/ month</span></div>\n<p class=\"small muted per\">Billed monthly</p>\n<ul class=\"grow\">\n<li>Unlimited projects</li>\n<li>100 GB storage</li>\n<li>Advanced analytics</li>\n<li>Priority email support</li>\n<li>Custom domains</li>\n<li class=\"off\">Shared workspaces</li>\n<li class=\"off\">Audit log &amp; SSO</li>\n</ul>\n<button class=\"btn btn-block\">Start 14-day free trial</button>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"card plan\">\n<div><h3>Team</h3><p class=\"muted small\">For teams collaborating with control and security.</p></div>\n<div><span class=\"price\" data-m=\"29\" data-y=\"23\">$29</span> <span class=\"muted\">/ user / month</span></div>\n<p class=\"small muted per\">Billed monthly</p>\n<ul class=\"grow\">\n<li>Everything in Pro</li>\n<li>1 TB pooled storage</li>\n<li>Shared workspaces</li>\n<li>Roles &amp; permissions</li>\n<li>Audit log &amp; SSO</li>\n<li>Dedicated success manager</li>\n<li>99.9% uptime SLA</li>\n</ul>\n<button class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-block\">Contact sales</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"card\">\n<h3 class=\"card-title\">Compare at a glance</h3>\n<table class=\"table\">\n<thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>Free</th><th>Pro</th><th>Team</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td>Projects</td><td>3</td><td>Unlimited</td><td>Unlimited</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Storage</td><td>1 GB</td><td>100 GB</td><td>1 TB pooled</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Support</td><td>Community</td><td>Priority email</td><td>Dedicated manager</td></tr>\n<tr><